# S08: In-Repo Instance Planning

## App-agent protocol

All tasks follow `APP-AGENT-PROTOCOL.md` + `templates/PD-APP-AGENT-BLOCK.md`.
MCP-first execution per S07 pattern — see `.ptl` MCP table.

## MCP-first execution (MANDATORY on every PM task)

| Phase | Tools |
|-------|-------|
| Preflight | `explain("organization-planning")`, `explain("work-control")`, `explain("<slug>")` |
| Discover | `get-app-structure("work-control")`, `get-file`, `list-apps` |
| Verify | `census()`, `get-page`, `bun run feature:health`, `bun run test` |

## Objective

Implement what S07 documented as **future** in `documentation-layers.md`: per-app instance
planning at `apps/<app>/planning/sprints/`. Migrate work-control `totem-reader` / `totem-writer`
to in-repo paths with backward-compatible fallback to external totem.

**First instance:** `apps/work-control/planning/` (orchestrator dogfoods on itself).
**S09** adds `apps/todo` (:3004).

## Foundation decisions (see S08-INVARIANTS.md)

- Default Accept target: `work-control` → `apps/work-control/planning/sprints/`
- `targetApp` field on epics (DB + API + UI)
- Legacy `WORK_CONTROL_TOTEM_PATH` still works — not removed
- External totem S01–S07 remain historical archive

